<title>UK: Sainsbury up on Kleinwort, BZW upgrade.</title>
<headline>Sainsbury up on Kleinwort, BZW upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in supermarket group J. Sainsbury Plc led the sector higher in active trade on Thursday after analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and BZW upgraded their stance on the stock to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot;.</p>
<p>The shares were up 9-1/2p to 409p by 0834 GMT after reaching a twelve-month high of 412p in early trade. Volume was 4.8 million shares.</p>
